een F-150 engines and Mustang Coyote engines will be the camshaft durations\n* Product Features\n\t+ F-150 camshafts feature a shorter duration on the intake camshaft for better low-end torque\n\nVI. Industry News\n\n* Headline: Aftermarket Industry Embraces Gen III and Gen IV Small Blocks\n* Description\n\t+ Many possibilities with factory components\n\t+ Aftermarket intakes and accessories have opened up the options and proven that there\'s power to be found\n\nVII. Videos\n\n* Video Titles\n\t+ Redline Rebuild\n\t+ Chip Foose Draws a Car\n\t+ First wash in 40 years: Detailing our Barn Find Chevy\n* Video Descriptions\n\t+ Second chance for a stodgy Stovebolt 6 with Redline Rebuild\n\t+ Reinventing the 1966 Ford Bronco with street-savvy style by Chip Foose\n\t+ Detailing a Barn Find Chevy with Larry from Hagerty\n\nVIII. Engine Comparison\n\n* Headline: Differences between Mustang 5.0 Coyote Engines and F-150 Variants\n* Description\n\t+ Significant differences in camshaft profiles, changes in the', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=4, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [128000, 40914, 11, 1618, 596, 279, 31648, 1623, 6070, 369, 279, 3997, 1701, 279, 16570, 330, 6109, 2778, 3135, 25, 1357, 731, 2418, 333, 18938, 11, 37384, 22598, 291, 220, 679, 19, 435, 4373, 435, 12, 3965, 52518, 40, 13, 68535, 271, 9, 18464, 4821, 198, 197, 10, 5492, 198, 197, 10, 14355, 555, 25736, 198, 197, 10, 10180, 4073, 198, 9, 16905, 11360, 198, 197, 10, 4758, 315, 220, 679, 19, 435, 4373, 435, 12, 3965, 198, 197, 10, 11452, 1074, 25, 41813, 4718, 220, 679, 19, 435, 4373, 435, 12, 3965, 449, 37384, 22598, 291, 1357, 731