INFO 02-21 09:28:45 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-72c3ab309f9848a682f60c832a8e7554-0: prompt: "There are a few notable things that are missing from the code as it is currently written:\n\n1. Error handling: The code does not include any error handling for invalid user input. For example, if the player enters an invalid cryptocurrency or an invalid number when prompted, the code will not handle the error and will simply terminate.\n2. Security: The code does not include any security measures to protect against malicious attacks or fraud.\n3. Persistent storage: The code does not include any mechanism for storing the player's balance or game history between sessions. This means that if the player closes the program, their balance will be reset to the initial amount.\n4. Real-time cryptocurrency exchange rates: The code does not include any mechanism for updating the exchange rates for the different cryptocurrencies in real time. This means that the value of the player's balance may fluctuate based on changes in the market.\n5. Advanced game features: The code for the blackjack, roulette, and slots games is relatively basic and does not include advanced features such as side bets or bonus rounds.\n6. User interface: The code does not include any user interface beyond simple text-based prompts and input.\n7. Testing: The code has not been thoroughly tested and may contain bugs or other issues.\n\nOverall, this code is meant to be a starting point for a crypto casino and could be further developed and refined to add more features and functionality.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=13, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decodin