INFO 02-21 09:29:05 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-1e630cbd21464b62b3de003cd58de3e1-0: prompt: "Here's a revised version:\n\nUser research plays a crucial role in product development. By conducting research, businesses and product development teams can gain valuable insights that help them make informed decisions about their products. User research helps to:\n\n* Explain user behavior by observing how users interact with a product or service\n* Gain a deeper understanding of user needs and preferences by gathering feedback and data\n* Identify pain points, difficulties, and barriers that users face when using a product\n* Understand how customers feel about a solution, product, feature, etc by conducting surveys or user interviews\n\nFrom there, businesses and product development teams can use this information to:\n\n* Select target customer segments that are most likely to benefit from the product\n* Understand the user's choice of problem to solve, which informs product development\n* Develop appropriate pricing strategies, reach channels, messages, etc to effectively market the product\n* Make informed choices about which features to develop and how to design the product's user interface and user experience.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=18, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [128000, 8586, 596, 264, 32828, 2373, 1473, 1502, 3495, 11335, 264, 16996, 3560, 304, 2027, 4500, 13, 3296, 31474, 3495, 11, 9873, 323, 2027, 4500, 7411, 649, 8895, 15525, 26793, 430, 1520, 1124, 1304, 16369, 11429, 922, 872, 3956, 13, 2724, 3495, 8779, 311, 1473, 9, 83017, 1217, 7865, 555, 46071, 1268, 3932, 16