INFO 02-21 09:29:06 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-52e7b23329ee49b4874d99f3bc30f30f-0: prompt: 'Grumpy Cat: Before we go, I have to ask: what’s the story behind your store’s name, Hi-Fi Rush?\n\nChai: (laughs) Well, it’s actually a bit of a funny story. When I was younger, I used to work at a record store. One day, a customer came in and asked me for a specific album, but I misheard him and thought he said “hi-fi rush” instead of the actual album name. We both had a good laugh about it, and when I opened up my own store years later, I decided to use that as the name.\n\nGrumpy Cat: (laughs) That’s hilarious. I love how sometimes mistakes can turn into something great like that.\n\nChai: Yeah, it’s funny how life works out sometimes.\n\nGrumpy Cat: Well, that’s all the time we have for today. Thanks for sharing your expertise on module federation in Vue and your fun story about Hi-Fi Rush, Chai. Until next time, meow.\n\nChai: Thanks for having me, Grumpy Cat. It was a pleasure.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=12, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [128000, 6600, 6895, 17810, 25, 13538, 584, 733, 11, 358, 617, 311, 2610, 25, 1148, 753, 279, 3446, 4920, 701, 3637, 753, 836, 11, 21694, 27395, 35175, 1980, 1163, 2192, 25, 320, 73556, 8, 8489, 11, 433, 753, 3604, 264, 2766, 315, 264, 15526, 3446, 13, 3277, 358, 574, 14992, 11, 358, 1511, 311, 990, 520, 264, 3335, 3637, 13, 3861, 1938, 11, 264, 6130, 3782, 304, 323, 4691, 757, 369, 264, 3230, 8176, 11, 719, 358, 5906, 55603, 1461, 323, 3463, 568, 1071, 1054, 6151, 37731, 13270, 863, 4619, 315, 279, 5150, 8176, 836, 13, 1226, 2225, 1047, 264, 16